---@field classifiedCount number The number of expected occurrences with a terminal access or presence classification.
---@field unclassifiedCount number The number of expected occurrences that required system verification could not classify.
---@field coveredCount number The number of classified expected occurrences actually represented in the produced snapshot. Access to a container or its descendants does not invent a resource occurrence.

